    "project_template_level_name": "ai-generated-design-lesson8-level4-template-test_2026",
    "long_instructions": "##Apply POUR to Your Own App\r\n<br/> 1. Inspect your own app or page and identify 2-3 accessibility issues using the POUR framework.\r\n\r\n:::details [Don't have an app to inspect?]\r\nPrompt AI to create a simple page with a prompt like this:\r\n\r\n> Create the HTML and CSS for a simple one-page website that includes a few accessibility problems a student could identify and improve, such as vague button text, weak page structure, or unclear navigation.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n<br/> 2. Use the accessibility prompts in the [Prompt Playbook](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/prompting-playbook/classes/accessibility-prompts) to write AI prompts that suggest fixes.\r\n\r\n<br/> 3. Run your prompts in the AI and revise your app or page by applying at least 1–2 accessibility improvements.\r\n",
    "submittable": "true",
